  'Passage 5 (Q126 – Q130): Policy and Circular Networks (Course 2)\nA regional authority asks companies to collect products after use. It promotes producer responsibility, information-sharing, marketplaces for secondary materials, and community repair groups. The authority reviews European and Flanders policy examples.'

